 irst (s.36(1)) - a missed preservation date cannot be cured by this one [C
 onstruction Act s.36(2)] Falls on a weekend/holiday: last business day to 
 act is 2026-08-28. Saturday filing deadline: file by the Friday\; an offic
 e-closed extension may exist but do not rely on it. Administrative reminde
 r\, not legal advice - verify with counsel.
